{
  "description": "What an agent does with a probe request, whatever it says (guarantee 3): at most 32 targets and 8 ports each in the order given, the rest dropped; a public address is skipped unless the host allows public targets (CONNLOG_PROBE_PUBLIC). `tried` is every (address, port) the agent may open, port null for ICMP; `skipped` is reported with outcome skipped.",
